Feature: Kinds of tower
  A tower is a fort, a spire or a depot. The map fixes the kind. The kinds differ in how far
  their radio shadow goes, how far they see and how many points they give.

  The two home towers are forts. A fort blocks the radio of the enemy 160 m round it. The centre
  tower is the spire. It blocks the radio 200 m round it, it sees 250 m when a team holds it,
  and it gives two points each second. The west and the east tower are depots. A depot blocks
  the radio 120 m round it.

  Expectation: A fort blocks the radio 160 m round it
    Given the Red home tower is held by Red
    And the first Blue drone is 150 m from the Red home tower
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is cut

  Expectation: A fort does not block the radio more than 160 m away
    Overrides: A fort blocks the radio 160 m round it
    The drone is outside the radio shadow.

    Given the Red home tower is held by Red
    And the first Blue drone is 170 m from the Red home tower
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is in contact

  Expectation: The spire blocks the radio 200 m round it
    Given the centre tower is held by Red
    And the first Blue drone is 190 m from the centre tower
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is cut

  Expectation: The spire does not block the radio more than 200 m away
    Overrides: The spire blocks the radio 200 m round it
    The drone is outside the radio shadow.

    Given the centre tower is held by Red
    And the first Blue drone is 210 m from the centre tower
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is in contact

  Expectation: A depot blocks the radio 120 m round it
    Given the west tower is held by Red
    And the first Blue drone is 110 m from the west tower
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is cut

  Expectation: A depot does not block the radio more than 120 m away
    Overrides: A depot blocks the radio 120 m round it
    The drone is outside the radio shadow.

    Given the west tower is held by Red
    And the first Blue drone is 130 m from the west tower
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is in contact
